{
  "name": "ResetDeviceSecret",
  "summary": "重置设备密钥",
  "tags": "设备管理",
  "productshort": "IoTDA",
  "region_id": "af-south-1",
  "paths": {
    "/v5/iot/{project_id}/devices/{device_id}/action": {
      "post": {
        "tags": [
          "DeviceManagement"
        ],
        "summary": "重置设备密钥",
        "description": "应用服务器可调用此接口重置设备密钥,携带指定密钥时平台将设备密钥重置为指定的密钥,不携带密钥时平台将自动生成一个新的随机密钥返回。",
        "operationId": "ResetDeviceSecret",
        "consumes": [
          "application/json"
        ],
        "produces": [
          "application/json"
        ],
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "project_id",
            "in": "path",
            "description": "**参数说明**:项目ID。获取方法请参见 [获取项目ID](https://support.huaweicloud.com/api-iothub/iot_06_v5_1001.html) 。",
            "required": true,
            "type": "string",
            "pattern": "^[a-fA-F0-9]{1,32}$",
            "x-example": "04ed32dc1b0025b52fe3c01a27c2b0a8"
          },
          {
            "name": "Instance-Id",
            "in": "header",
            "description": "**参数说明**:实例ID。物理多租下各实例的唯一标识,一般华为云租户无需携带该参数,仅在物理多租场景下从管理面访问API时需要携带该参数。您可以在IoTDA管理控制台界面,选择左侧导航栏“总览”页签查看当前实例的ID",
            "required": false,
            "type": "string",
            "pattern": "[0-9a-f-]{1,36}",
            "x-example": "1a7ffc5c-d89c-44dd-8265-b1653d951ce0"
          },
          {
            "name": "device_id",
            "in": "path",
            "description": "**参数说明**:设备ID,用于唯一标识一个设备。在注册设备时直接指定,或者由物联网平台分配获得。由物联网平台分配时,生成规则为\"product_id\" + \"_\" + \"node_id\"拼接而成。\n**取值范围**:长度不超过128,只允许字母、数字、下划线(_)、连接符(-)的组合。",
            "required": true,
            "type": "string",
            "pattern": "^[a-zA-Z0-9_-]{1,128}$"
          },
          {
            "name": "action_id",
            "in": "query",
            "description": "**参数说明**:对设备执行的操作。\n**取值范围**:\n- resetSecret: 重置密钥。注意:NB设备密钥由于协议特殊性,只支持十六进制密钥接入。",
            "required": true,
            "type": "string",
            "pattern": "(resetSecret)"
          },
          {
            "in": "body",
            "name": "ResetDeviceSecretRequestBody",
            "description": "request",
            "required": true,
            "schema": {
              "$ref": "#/definitions/ResetDeviceSecret"
            }
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "OK",
            "examples": {
              "application/json": {
                "device_id": "d4922d8a-6c8e-4396-852c-164aefa6638f",
                "secret": "3b93****dc3c"
              }
            },
            "schema": {
              "$ref": "#/definitions/DeviceSecret"
            }
          },
          "403": {
            "description": "Forbidden",
            "x-Error": [
              "IOTDA.000022"
            ]
          },
          "404": {
            "description": "Not Found",
            "x-Error": [
              "IOTDA.014000"
            ]
          },
          "500": {
            "description": "Internal Server Error"
          }
        },
        "x-support-sdk": "Y",
        "x-is-registered": "Y",
        "x-publishpath": "iot_06_v5_0093",
        "x-apig-name": "IoTDA_API",
        "x-externalAPI": true,
        "x-interfaceRisk": "HIGH",
        "x-iftype": "OpenAPI_new",
        "x-returnType": "ResponseEntity<DeviceSecret>",
        "x-request-examples-url-1": "POST https://{endpoint}/v5/iot/{project_id}/devices/{device_id}/action?action_id=resetSecret",
        "x-request-examples-1": {
          "secret": "3b935a250c50dc2c6d481d048cefdc3c",
          "force_disconnect": false
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "definitions": {
    "DeviceSecret": {
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "device_id": {
          "type": "string",
          "example": "d4922d8a-6c8e-4396-852c-164aefa6638f",
          "description": "设备ID,用于唯一标识一个设备。在注册设备时直接指定,或者由物联网平台分配获得。由物联网平台分配时,生成规则为\"product_id\" + \"_\" + \"node_id\"拼接而成。",
          "maxLength": 256,
          "x-isSensitive": true
        },
        "secret": {
          "type": "string",
          "example": "3b935a250c50dc2c6d481d048cefdc3c",
          "description": "设备密钥。",
          "minLength": 8,
          "maxLength": 32,
          "pattern": "^[a-zA-Z0-9_-]*$",
          "x-isSensitive": true
        },
        "secret_type": {
          "description": "**参数说明**:重置设备秘钥的的类型。\n**取值范围**:\n- PRIMARY:重置主秘钥。设备秘钥鉴权优先使用的密钥,当设备接入物联网平台时,平台将优先使用主密钥进行校验。\n- SECONDARY:重置辅秘钥。设备的备用密钥,当主密钥校验不通过时,会启用辅密钥校验,辅密钥与主密钥有相同的效力;辅密钥对coap协议接入的设备不生效。",
          "pattern": "PRIMARY|SECONDARY",
          "type": "string",
          "example": "PRIMARY",
          "default": "PRIMARY"
        }
      },
      "title": "重置设备密钥响应结构体"
    },
    "ResetDeviceSecret": {
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "secret": {
          "type": "string",
          "example": "3b935a250c50dc2c6d481d048cefdc3c",
          "description": "**参数说明**:设备密钥,设置该字段时平台将设备密钥重置为指定值,若不设置则由平台自动生成。\n**取值范围**:长度不低于8不超过32,只允许字母、数字、下划线(_)、连接符(-)的组合。",
          "minLength": 8,
          "maxLength": 32,
          "pattern": "^[a-zA-Z0-9_-]*$",
          "x-sensitive": true
        },
        "force_disconnect": {
          "type": "boolean",
          "example": false,
          "description": "**参数说明**:是否强制断开设备的连接,当前仅限长连接。默认值false。",
          "default": false
        },
        "secret_type": {
          "description": "**参数说明**:重置设备秘钥的的类型。\n**取值范围**:\n- PRIMARY:重置主秘钥。设备秘钥鉴权优先使用的密钥,当设备接入物联网平台时,平台将优先使用主密钥进行校验。\n- SECONDARY:重置辅秘钥。设备的备用密钥,当主密钥校验不通过时,会启用辅密钥校验,辅密钥与主密钥有相同的效力;辅密钥对coap协议接入的设备不生效。",
          "pattern": "PRIMARY|SECONDARY",
          "type": "string",
          "example": "PRIMARY",
          "default": "PRIMARY"
        }
      },
      "title": "重置设备密钥请求结构体"
    }
  },
  "version": "2.0",
  "parameters": {},
  "host": "iotda.af-south-1.myhuaweicloud.com",
  "base_path": null,
  "info_version": "v5",
  "method": "post",
  "uri": null
}